---
import { EARLY_ACCESS_URL } from '../config';
---
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <video class="bgv parallax" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/media/hero.jpg?v=3" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/media/hero.mp4?v=3" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="shade"></div>
  <div class="grain"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="mask" aria-label="Just the right horsepower.">
      <span class="ln"><span>Just the right</span></span>
      <span class="ln"><span><em>horsepower.</em></span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="sub">A Claude Code plugin. Each subtask runs on the cheapest model that can do it, gets checked before “done” counts, and steps up one model only if the check fails.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="pill silk" href={EARLY_ACCESS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get early access</a>
      <a class="textlink" href="#race">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="installbar is-off" aria-label="Install command, available at launch"><span class="p">›</span><code>/plugin install horsy</code><span class="soon">· at launch</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:210px"></div>
</header>
